==Battleground==
*2 [[Othom]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Oldhorn]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Ancient Magamojoe]] spawns as the boss after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]] is recommended, as there is hardly any cash to go around with the complete lack of peons. You're going to want to use [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern Cat]] and [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Cone Cat]] as your primary meatshields, alongside the [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]]. When the stage starts, stall the Othom and save up money for [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] or [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]] to quickly kill it before the Oldhorn catches up. If you're using Naala, you'll want to Slow Oldhorn using [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]]. By the time Oldhorn dies, Ancient Magamojoe will make his appearance, so quickly get rid of him with your anti-Relics/Behemoths like [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]] and [[Dogumaru (Special Cat)|Reborn Warrior Doguemon]]. Once Magamojoe is dead, the cleanup process is easy! Just slime the second Oldhorn out with your anti-Relics and use [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] to destroy Mr. Puffington if need be.

